language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit PresentationManager.
capability ReplaceablePresentation.
functionality BuildPresentationSchema.
functionality ValidatePresentationBindings.
functionality PublishPresentationRevision.
functionality FormatPresentationValue.
functionality PreservePresentationContinuity.

BoxUI contains PresentationManager.
PresentationManager provides ReplaceablePresentation.
PresentationManager status proposed.
PresentationManager cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
PresentationManager owns BuildPresentationSchema.
BuildPresentationSchema realizes ReplaceablePresentation.
BuildPresentationSchema specifies "Select schema using structural discriminator, available bindings and trusted view kinds; ordinary values generate patches.".
PresentationManager owns ValidatePresentationBindings.
ValidatePresentationBindings realizes ReplaceablePresentation.
ValidatePresentationBindings specifies "Check typed binding targets, renderer capabilities, schema and Composition contract revision.".
PresentationManager owns PublishPresentationRevision.
PublishPresentationRevision realizes ReplaceablePresentation.
PublishPresentationRevision specifies "Atomic schema publication only after current relevant revision check; invalid/stale candidates retain active valid schema under the specified policy.".
PresentationManager owns FormatPresentationValue.
FormatPresentationValue realizes ReplaceablePresentation.
FormatPresentationValue specifies "Localized labels, display units/precision and abstract styles without changing underlying quantity or value.".
PresentationManager owns PreservePresentationContinuity.
PreservePresentationContinuity realizes ReplaceablePresentation.
PreservePresentationContinuity specifies "Keep Representation identity, subscriptions, command correlation and domain draft during schema replacement; local focus/text policy remains explicit.".
